## 1. Definitions

**"The Work"** means the NingX-EnggTeam repository: its source files, documentation, skills, agents, rules, commands, hooks, and any part of them.

**"The Author"** means Nitin Sharma, the original creator of the Work.

**"Rebrand"** means any of the following, in whole or in part:

- renaming the Work, or any distributed derivative of it, to a name other than **NingX-EnggTeam**
- removing, replacing, obscuring, or altering the name **NingX-EnggTeam**
- removing, replacing, or obscuring the credit **"Made by Nitin Sharma"** or any other attribution to the Author
- replacing the Author's name with another person's or organisation's name
- presenting the Work, or a derivative of it, as the original creation of anyone other than the Author
- applying a new logo, brand identity, or product identity to a distributed derivative
- publishing a derivative under a different project name, package name, marketplace slug, or repository name

**"Derivative"** means any modification, adaptation, translation, extension, subset, or recombination of the Work.

**"Distribute"** means to publish, share, upload, sell, sublicense, or otherwise make the Work or a Derivative available to any third party.

