## 5. Permission for rebranding

Rebranding is available **only with prior written permission from the Author**.

To request permission, open an issue at https://github.com/codeandearnyt/NingX-EnggTeam/issues stating:

1. What you intend to rebrand.
2. The name and identity you intend to use.
3. Whether the result will be distributed commercially.

The Author may grant, refuse, or grant with conditions, at their sole discretion. No permission is granted by silence, by failure to respond, or by any prior practice.

